  "description": {
    "text": "The 2009 tournament, announced as the next official tournament after Battle Road Spring 2008 was cut short, held its first stage in all 47 prefectures from 12 October 2008 to 25 January 2009, with card game rounds played with 30-card half decks; its participation pack held holo Gible, Gabite and Garchomp. After six regional second-stage tournaments in March and April 2009, the final was held at the Prince Park Tower Tokyo on 4 May 2009, where the top finishers got Wonder Platinum 033/DPt-P in an acrylic plaque, blue for the card game and red for the video game.",
